<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1560_5639.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlich</unclear> willig dienst, und was wir ehren
<lb n="2"/>liebs und guets <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear> zuvor, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">from</unclear>, fürsichtig, ehr-
<lb n="3"/>sam, wyß, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">insonders</unclear> guet fründt, und gethrüw lieb
<lb n="4"/><orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnossen</unclear></orgName>. Nachdem wir den abscheid
<lb n="5"/>deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letst</unclear> der Badischen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarrechnung</unclear>, belangend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwe</unclear>-
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">re</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> lieben Eidt: und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pundtsgnossen</unclear> der
<lb n="7"/>Drygen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pündten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschwerliche</unclear> leidige handlung, für
<lb n="8"/>uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genomen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">user</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear> darüber ge-
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebenen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyteren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mündtlichen</unclear> bericht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angehoert</unclear>, und
<lb n="10"/>auch uff hüt von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> gestrigs tags wider heimb-
<lb n="11"/>khomnen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsandten</unclear>, wellichen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nebenet</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>der übrigen drygen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">orten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rathsbotten</unclear>, uff das
<lb n="13"/>ab der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarrechnung</unclear> zue <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> uns zuekhomen schryben,
<lb n="14"/>inn die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pündt</unclear> abgefertiget, inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">syner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gethonen</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>relation und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uß</unclear> dem schrifftlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abscheidt</unclear> vernomen,
<lb n="16"/>was er und die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dryg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitgsandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daselbst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verrichtet</unclear>,
<lb n="17"/>und wie der ober Graw <persName resp="#ner">Pundt</persName>, inen den vier
<lb n="18"/>Eidtgnossischen abgesanten, inn den vier underschid-
<lb n="19"/>lichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgebrachten</unclear> puncten, als mit abschaff-
<lb n="20"/>ung deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straffgrichts</unclear> und deren widerumb zue denen
<lb n="21"/>gezogenen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vendlinen</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uffhebung</unclear> deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">straffgrichts</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urteilnen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Item</unclear> verordnen unparthygischer verstand-
<lb n="23"/>iger personen von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhaten</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gmeinden</unclear>, zue den ge-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">santen</unclear> der orten und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuegewandten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berath</unclear>-
<lb n="25"/>schlagung und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebürender</unclear> verrichtung der sachen:
<lb n="26"/>wie auch deß tags und orts der zuesamenkhunfft, und
<lb n="27"/>dann auch deß gleits den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußgetrettnen</unclear>, ires <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begehr</unclear>-
<lb n="28"/>ens schon <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allbereit</unclear> durchuß gewillfahret, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetwillig</unclear> begeben, dem rath der <orgName resp="#ner">Eidtgnossen</orgName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zefolgen</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>und dieselben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> sachen handlen zelassen, Un-
<lb n="31"/>der übrigen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beiden</unclear> deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gotshuß</unclear> und der Zechen
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grichten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pundts</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">halber</unclear>, ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soeliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">starcke</unclear> ver-
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">trostung</unclear> und guete hoffnung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhanden</unclear>, das dieselben
<lb n="34"/>sich glychergstalt auch also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> der <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Graw</unclear> Pundt</persName>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willfahrig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ercleren</unclear>, und demselbigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertroesteten</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1560_5640.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">entschluß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angentz</unclear> inn gschrifft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueberschiken</unclear> werdint.
<lb n="37"/>Habend wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ueber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söliches</unclear> alles inn diser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erntzhafften</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bedenkens</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehept</unclear>. Und befindend inn
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erduerung</unclear> der handlung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sovil</unclear>, das wir der wol-
<lb n="40"/>getrösten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unzwyfelichen</unclear> hoffnung sind, es werdint
<lb n="41"/>die sachen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beßer</unclear> dann man <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeint</unclear> und sich an-
<lb n="42"/>sehen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">laßen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgahn</unclear>. Also dz es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angeschlagnen</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kriegiischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufruchs</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwalts</unclear> einer <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßschafft</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="44"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogewandten</unclear> (wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söliches</unclear> der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathschlag</unclear>
<lb n="45"/>und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abscheidt</unclear> der jüngsten <placeName resp="#ner">Badischen</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jarsrechnung</unclear> ver-
<lb n="46"/>mag) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nützet</unclear> bedörffen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sonders</unclear> die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear> noch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wol</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> andere <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mitel</unclear> und den weg <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fründtlicher</unclear> hand-
<lb n="48"/>lung, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gwalt</unclear> an die hand <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zenemen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuerender</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> verrichtet werden mögen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wellich</unclear>-
<lb n="50"/>es nun, und sonderlichen ouch das wir die sorg und
<lb n="51"/>das bedencken <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tragend</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diewyl</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="52"/>von den Papistischen orten, sich so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hitzig</unclear> wider die
<lb n="53"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-775" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dryg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Pündt</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzeigend</unclear>, und den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> ange-
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sechnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufbruch</unclear> also <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schnell</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gar</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werkh</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>zerichten understand. Das sy <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alßbald</unclear> es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear>
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-775" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Dryg</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Pündten</unclear></orgName> halber und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ouch</unclear> gegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear>
<lb n="57"/>anderen nit so guet <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermeind</unclear>, sonders etwas anders
<lb n="58"/>darhinder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steken</unclear> möchte. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verursachet</unclear> hatt, das
<lb n="59"/>wir uß denen und anderen mehr inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diseren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoch</unclear>-
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wichtigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschefft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> fürfallenden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolbedenklich</unclear>-
<lb n="61"/>en ursachen, nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathsam</unclear> finden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">könnend</unclear>, das
<lb n="62"/>der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschechne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathschlag</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufbruchs</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angesechner</unclear> maßen dißmals <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürgange</unclear>, sonders
<lb n="64"/>hat unß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nothwendig</unclear> syn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedunckht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angentz</unclear> ein
<lb n="65"/>tagleistung aller orten und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuogewandten</unclear> gen
<lb n="66"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> zubeschryben. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Namblichen</unclear> uff <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sontag</unclear> den
<lb n="67"/>26.ten diß louffenden monats</date> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abents</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daselbst</unclear> an
<lb n="68"/>der herberg <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerschynen</unclear>. Und üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dar</unclear>-
<lb n="69"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nebent</unclear> (wie gegen uebrigen orten ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschicht</unclear>)
